    <string name="tool_sheet_note">Sheets are A4. Text, lists, tables and pictures (PNG, JPG, GIF, BMP, WebP) are converted. Headers, footers, text boxes and Word-only picture types (EMF, WMF) are left out, and the look can differ a little from Word.</string>
    <string name="about_developer">Developer: Karthik Hegde</string>
    <string name="about_description">Kosh is an offline toolbox for your documents. Scan paper and photos into PDFs, read PDFs with search, highlights and doodles, keep notes with checklists and pictures, and use the PDF tools to merge, split, rotate, reorder, number, compress, lock and unlock files, and turn Word files into PDFs. Everything happens on your device, and Kosh has no internet permission.</string>
    <string name="about_license">Kosh is free software, released under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0). You can use, study, share and change it under the terms of that licence.</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Built with open-source software: PdfBox-Android and pdf.js (Apache License 2.0) and pdf-lib (MIT).</string>
    <string name="about_github">Kosh on GitHub</string>
